  "review": {
    "images": "Eight native Nakheel render images from the current Palm Central brochure. The original page references preserve the source for the cove, buildings and townhouse interiors.",
    "location": "Nakheel’s map link yields 25.0057641, 54.9857843. Physical brochure pages 8 and 9 provide the regional estimates and island masterplan. The corporate project page differs by one minute on the DWC and Palm Jumeirah routes, so the panel identifies the brochure scope.",
    "floorPlans": "The current official book supplies 21 sheets corresponding to the Frond N release and the Mitchell’s-hosted Nakheel original supplies 26 Frond M sheets. Unit tables and type captions were visually checked. The visible Frond M D, D (2 BR) and E totals were checked directly against the printed columns after the file’s underlying text omitted or duplicated some rows. The Frond N Type B townhouse drawing shows five bedrooms over two levels."
  },
